---
source: crates/cli/tests/native.rs
expression: run.stdout
---
Fast, native developer tools

Usage: tw <COMMAND>

Commands:
  base64       Encode and decode Base64 (RFC 4648)
  url          Percent-encode and decode text for URLs
  uuid         Generate UUIDs: random (v4) or time-ordered (v7)
  list         List every tool
  completions  Print shell completions
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
